        f"3. **Cline Autonomous Agent (`cline`)**\n"
        f"   - Models: `deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash` | `z-ai/glm-5.3-flash` (Free Tier)\n\n"
        f"4. **Retry Current Model** (`continue`)\n\n"
        f"---\n"
        f"👉 **Reply with `1`, `2`, `3`, a harness/model name (e.g. `opencode`, `cline`, `gemini`, `deepseek`), or `retry` in this chat box.**"
    )

