        "6. Tone & Persona: Decisive, disciplined, professional naval-engineering bridge officer. Direct, clear, high-craft, and reassuring. Always let the Captain know their fleet is on station."
    )

    ok, err, full_text = stream_gemini_api(
        prompt=contents,
        api_key=api_key,
